  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Yeung",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Yeung.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Michelle Yeung is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 35 149 522 861) (MED0001490643) consulting at the Sans Souci centre.",
      "Dr Michelle Yeung graduated from the University of London and worked in London for a few years before coming to Australia. She embarked on physician training at Westmead and St Vincent’s Hospital before entering into training in family medicine. She was awarded the Fellowship with the Royal Australian College of General Practitioners and registered with the Medical Board of Australia as a Specialist in General Practice. She enjoys solving medical problems and has special interests in palliative care, women’s health and preventative medicine.",
      "Dr Yeung can speak fluent English, Cantonese and basic Mandarin."
    ]
  },
  "fellowships": [
    "Consultant Specialist GP",
